<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2087] Ignite CacheManager ignores provided class loader</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2087</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;CacheManager&lt;/tt&gt; should delegate the provided class loader to &lt;tt&gt;IgniteConfiguration.setClassLoader()&lt;/tt&gt;. Currently it&apos;s ignored.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;user@ thread: &lt;a href=&quot;http://apache-ignite-users.70518.x6.nabble.com/Help-with-integrating-Ignite-as-JCache-with-JBoss-EAP-6-4-td2134.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://apache-ignite-users.70518.x6.nabble.com/Help-with-integrating-Ignite-as-JCache-with-JBoss-EAP-6-4-td2134.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12919080">IGNITE-2087</key>
            <summary>Ignite CacheManager ignores provided class loader</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
                                            <priority id="2" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/priorities/critical.svg">Critical</priority>
                        <status id="6" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/statuses/closed.png" description="The issue is considered finished, the resolution is correct. Issues which are not closed can be reopened.">Closed</status>
                    <statusCategory id="3" key="done" colorName="green"/>
                                    <resolution id="10">Implemented</resolution>
                                        <assignee username="avinogradov">Anton Vinogradov (Obsolete, actual is &quot;av&quot;)</assignee>
                                    <reporter username="vkulichenko">Valentin Kulichenko</reporter>
                        <labels>
                    </labels>
                <created>Fri, 4 Dec 2015 20:55:21 +0000</created>
                <updated>Thu, 18 Aug 2016 12:21:44 +0000</updated>
                            <resolved>Thu, 18 Aug 2016 12:21:05 +0000</resolved>
                                                    <fixVersion>1.8</fixVersion>
                                    <component>cache</component>
                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>2</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15046258" author="vkulichenko" created="Tue, 8 Dec 2015 03:09:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We can also add optional &lt;tt&gt;gridName&lt;/tt&gt; property. If it&apos;s provided, &lt;tt&gt;CacheManager&lt;/tt&gt; will try to use existing Ignite instance instead of starting the new one. This way user will have an option to use JCache API without Spring.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15057930" author="avinogradov" created="Tue, 15 Dec 2015 11:56:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve added &lt;br/&gt;
cfg.setClassLoader(clsLdr); Where cfg is IgniteConfiguration.&lt;br/&gt;
inside CacheManager constructor. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This should helps.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15059425" author="vkulichenko" created="Wed, 16 Dec 2015 03:19:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We should also set class loader for non-default URI.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This can be achieved by passing the loader to &lt;tt&gt;IgnitionEx&lt;/tt&gt; and setting it to &lt;tt&gt;IgniteConfiguration&lt;/tt&gt; after it&apos;s loaded from the XML.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;UPD: I think &lt;tt&gt;IgniteConfiguration.setClassLoader&lt;/tt&gt; should not be called if the class loader is already explicitly set.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15060004" author="avinogradov" created="Wed, 16 Dec 2015 14:03:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Please check &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/345&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/345&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15061900" author="avinogradov" created="Thu, 17 Dec 2015 11:05:10 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;PR checked.&lt;br/&gt;
Left: write test for new methods.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15063265" author="vkulichenko" created="Fri, 18 Dec 2015 01:47:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Anton,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Changes look good. Please add tests and if OK, good to merge.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15066544" author="avinogradov" created="Mon, 21 Dec 2015 15:15:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed at 1.5, tests will be provided later.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15426345" author="avinogradov" created="Thu, 18 Aug 2016 12:21:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Seems, tests is not necessary 1 year later.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
